sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Viewer
  participant SPA as SPA · search feature
  participant NG as nginx (web)
  participant API as API · search slice
  participant C as CachedCatalogProvider
  participant T as TvMazeCatalogProvider
  participant TV as TVMaze API
  U->>SPA: types "dark"
  Note over SPA: debounce 350 ms · URL becomes ?q=dark<br/>newer keystrokes abort older requests
  alt already in browser cache (5 min)
    SPA-->>U: tiles rendered instantly
  else not cached
    SPA->>NG: GET /api/v1/shows?q=dark
    NG->>API: proxy · X-Request-ID
    API->>API: validate q (1–100 chars)
    API->>C: search_shows("dark")
    alt server cache hit (TTL 5 min)
      C-->>API: ShowSummary[]
    else cache miss
      C->>T: search_shows("dark")
      T->>TV: GET /search/shows?q=dark
      Note over T,TV: timeout 5 s · retry 429/5xx with backoff · circuit breaker
      TV-->>T: [{score, show}]
      T->>T: TvMazeMapper → id, title, year, poster
      T-->>C: ShowSummary[]
      C-->>API: ShowSummary[] (now cached)
    end
    API-->>SPA: 200 {items: [{id, title, year, posterUrl}]}
    SPA-->>U: responsive tile grid
  end
  opt TVMaze down or circuit open
    API-->>SPA: 503 problem+json · catalog_unavailable
    SPA-->>U: "Our bees are taking a short nap" · Try again
  end
